{
  "name": "Adv 0 - 通知中心 [共用 Sub-Workflow：severity 分流 → Discord / Email]",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Adv 0：通知中心（Notify Hub）\n\n**所有情境共用的通知出口** — Adv 1-6 的關鍵事件都打到這裡，\n由這一個 workflow 統一決定怎麼通知、通知誰。\n\n**呼叫方式**（任何 workflow 加一個 HTTP Request 節點）：\n```\nPOST http://localhost:5678/webhook/notify-hub\n{ \"source\": \"adv1-dedup\", \"severity\": \"critical\",\n  \"title\": \"新 Critical 事件\", \"message\": \"...\" }\n```\n\n**分流規則**：\n- critical → Discord @here 緊急通知（+ Email，需 SMTP 設定後啟用）\n- 其他 → Discord 一般訊息\n\n**集中的好處**：換通知管道（Teams/LINE/簡訊）只改這裡，\n六個情境 workflow 一行都不用動。",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 480
      },
      "id": "adv0-note",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-64, -208]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Discord Webhook 設定\n\n1. Discord 伺服器 → 頻道設定 → 整合 → Webhook → 新增\n2. 複製 Webhook URL，替換本 workflow 兩個 HTTP 節點的 URL\n\n### Email（選用）\n\n「Email: 緊急信件」節點預設 disabled。\n啟用步驟：Settings → Credentials → 新增 SMTP\n（Gmail 需用應用程式密碼），然後 enable 該節點。",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 380
      },
      "id": "adv0-note2",
      "name": "Sticky Note 2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1104, -160]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "notify-hub",
        "responseMode": "lastNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "adv0-wh",
      "name": "Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [-16, 304],
      "webhookId": "adv0-notify-hub-hook"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "adv0-manual",
      "name": "Demo Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-16, 512]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Demo 用通知：改 severity 為 'info' 可測一般訊息路徑\nreturn [{ json: {\n  source: 'demo',\n  severity: 'critical',\n  title: '通知中心測試',\n  message: '這是一則來自 Demo Trigger 的測試通知'\n} }];"
      },
      "id": "adv0-demo",
      "name": "Demo 通知",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [176, 512]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// 支援 Webhook（$json.body）與 Demo 路徑；欄位缺漏給安全預設\nconst b = $json.body?.title ? $json.body : $json;\nreturn [{ json: {\n  source: b.source || 'unknown',\n  severity: (b.severity || 'info').toLowerCase(),\n  title: b.title || '(無標題)',\n  message: b.message || ''\n} }];"
      },
      "id": "adv0-norm",
      "name": "整理通知",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [400, 304]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 1
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "sev1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.severity }}",
              "rightValue": "critical",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "adv0-if",
      "name": "IF: critical？",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [624, 304]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://discord.com/api/webhooks/YOUR_WEBHOOK_ID/YOUR_WEBHOOK_TOKEN",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ { content: '🚨 @here **[' + $json.source + '] ' + $json.title + '**\\n' + $json.message } }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "adv0-discord-crit",
      "name": "Discord: 緊急通知",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [848, 160]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://discord.com/api/webhooks/YOUR_WEBHOOK_ID/YOUR_WEBHOOK_TOKEN",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ { content: 'ℹ️ **[' + $json.source + '] ' + $json.title + '**\\n' + $json.message } }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "adv0-discord-info",
      "name": "Discord: 一般訊息",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [848, 448]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fromEmail": "n8n-ops@example.com",
        "toEmail": "oncall-team@example.com",
        "subject": "=[緊急] {{ $('整理通知').item.json.title }}",
        "text": "={{ $('整理通知').item.json.message }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "adv0-email",
      "name": "Email: 緊急信件",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailSend",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [1104, 160],
      "disabled": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const n = $('整理通知').item.json;\nreturn [{ json: {\n  notified: true,\n  channel: 'discord',\n  urgency: n.severity === 'critical' ? 'urgent' : 'normal',\n  source: n.source,\n  title: n.title\n} }];"
      },
      "id": "adv0-result",
      "name": "回報結果",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1104, 448]
    }
  ],
